      "description": "<p>When a thanadaemon damages a living creature with a melee Strike, the creature must succeed at a @Check[fortitude|dc:33] save or become Drained 1. Further damage dealt by the thanadaemon increases the drained condition value by 1 on a failed save, to a maximum of Drained 4.</p>",
